        "description": "Use this tool to retrieve the current status of a NovaStore order.\n\nCall this tool whenever the customer asks about the status, shipping, tracking, delivery, or location of a specific order.\n\nExtract the order ID from the customer's message and pass it as order_id.\n\nExample:\nCustomer: \"Where is my order NS-10452?\"\norder_id: \"NS-10452\"\n\nDo not use the knowledge base to answer live order-status questions. Always use this tool when an order ID is provided.",
